# Code mods built into the 3DS executable (build_mods.sh). All CC0, from the
# submodules in mods/: <repo> [<package>] (the ProxyBK repo builds one
# package at a time). They are built against this repository's bk-decomp and
# BanjoRecompSyms, not their own submodules.
ProxyBK_RecompMods ExitToLair
ProxyBK_RecompMods SkipIt
ProxyBK_RecompMods ToggleTrot
ProxyBK_RecompMods TransformAnywhere
ProxyBK_RecompMods AbilityAnywhere
ProxyBK_RecompMods Cheats
BanjoBeeMod
QuietTalonTrot
BK-Sir-Slush-Configuration
# The languages (one at a time: the Mods page's Language row) and the asset
# system they replace the game's text through, which is on only with one.
# For the 3DS's memory, mods/BKRecompAssetExpansionPak.3ds.patch sizes its
# heap and mods/BKSpanish.3ds.patch allocates Spanish's glyphs once.
# mods/Bardakoff-French.3ds.patch draws French's accented capitals itself, in
# place of the Font Plus Latin 1 mod it was written for.
BKRecompAssetExpansionPak
BKSpanish
BK-german
Bardakoff-French
